WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.440
A barbecue?

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.980
That's a great idea! But...

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.520
<i>Wouldn't that distract Ryuunosuke from his work? {At some point this show has to make the obvious comparison between her and Kobraja.}</i>

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.960
Don't worry about that!

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.970
The barbecue was his idea in the first place.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:17.590
The woods at Kibougamori are really pretty, you know! {What is this Kibougamori bullshit.}

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.160
I'm sure you'll enjoy it.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:23.830
Well, in that case, I guess I'll have to take you up on that offer.

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:26.670
Excuse me...

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:27.840
Welcome!

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.510
Sorry to run like this, Sakura, but we have a customer.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.300
What timing, so do we.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:34.920
Well, I'll call you to confirm the details, all right? {Ring -> call}

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:38.970
Toshioka, what flowers are you looking for today?

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.520
Well, um...

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:42.270
Is he a regular customer?

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.420
Yup. He buys a lot of bouquets from us.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.720
As presents for his girlfriend, he says!

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.440
Welcome!

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:55.490
What kind of clothes may I interest you in today?

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:01.200
I want something that'll make him love me more than anyone in the world! {Lingerie.}

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:04.250
I want flowers that'll bloom for all eternity!

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.310
Huh?!

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:07.980
{OP}

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.170
HeartCatch

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.630
Precure!

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.170
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:19.180
Now, all together

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:21.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:24.650
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:32.270
Within each of our chests,

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.940
they begin to sprout

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:36.570
The seeds of the heart

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:37.860
are growing

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:40.490
bit by bit

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:41.160
Red,

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:41.780
white

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:43.070
and yellow

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.870
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.290
all varied colors

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:48.750
that they

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:50.910
shine so brightly!

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:56.250
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.760
with such care

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:01.470
will never wither

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.050
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:07.930
Now, all together

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:10.390
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:13.060
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:17.940
They're always right by our sides

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:18.780
So together

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:22.660
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.610
bloom even more!

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:27.110
HeartCatch

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:28.620
Precure!

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.880
When you say you want flowers that'll bloom for all eternity...

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.400
you mean preserved flowers, right?

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:40.680
That's right. That's what I meant!

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.250
Preserved flowers?

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.450
They're flowers that've been plucked at full bloom,

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:49.200
then are processed in such a way that they don't wilt and will always stay beautiful.

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:55.000
Well, they won't last for all eternity, but they will last for a really long time.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.880
However, I'm afraid we don't sell them here...

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:01.880
But I've been wanting to get into them for a while now!

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:05.700
So if you like, Toshioka, I can get the tools and make them for you.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.330
You can?! That's great...

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.830
I want to give her a bouquet of preserved flowers...

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.420
"More than anyone in the world" is a little...

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:16.420
I thought if I went to Fairy Drop...

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.090
If I went to Kurumi Sakura, the super charismatic ex-model...

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:23.050
I thought you might be able to help me. {Removed the 'That' so it flows with the previous two lines.}

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:30.050
{MY MOUTH IS HUGE}Well, wearing my designs does tend to enrapture people.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.690
So I'm certain it'd work!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:32.900
Mom...

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.020
Oops, my bad.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:36.320
Young lady...

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.320
It might be a bit brazen of me to say this, but...

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:42.280
Being loved by someone...

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.490
is about more than just appearances, right?

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:49.460
You're probably right.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:52.460
But I want to make myself look prettier!

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:57.960
I want to win back his heart!

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:00.800
I want to win back her heart!

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.510
Win her back with preserved flowers?

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.220
That's right. I'm...

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:09.180
I'm going to propose to her!

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:11.640
Propose?!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:19.190
Hearts Aflutter<i>!</i>

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:19.190
Hearts Aflutter<i>!</i>

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.610
Proposing, huh?

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.100
What flowers do you think we should use, Tsubomi?

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:27.120
Well, roses are pretty much
 essential for this sort of thing!

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:32.640
We have a lot of designs to choose from.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:36.560
Or you can make an original design if you like, Toshioka.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:37.860
R-Right...

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:38.750
Toshioka?

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.530
You're nervous, aren't you?

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.930
I know the feeling.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:45.070
When I proposed to my dear wife here,

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:50.780
my throat felt so dry from nervousness that all the water in the world wouldn't put it right!

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:51.430
Dear...

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.930
Um, did something happen between you two?

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:04.400
The thing is, as of late, she just seems so distant!

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.970
I see.

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:08.570
So your boyfriend seems to be distant as of late. {Glasses Erika uguu~~}

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.940
Cut that out. {BEST FRAME}

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:11.370
Are you sure you're not imagining it?

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:16.080
We've been so busy with work lately that we just haven't had time to see each other.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:19.640
And when we do get to meet, it seems like he's hiding something from me.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:22.760
I don't think that's worth worrying yourself over!

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.550
When my husband and I were dating,

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.800
he once went overseas for a whole year!

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:32.950
Well, some people are just like that.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.830
You can't think so pessimistically about these things.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:35.640
You're wrong!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:39.900
I always thought this time might come.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:44.940
He's... Yuuto's brilliant, very kind, and really dashing.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.110
I don't deserve someone like him!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:53.540
I'm certain that Yuuto's fallen for someone else!

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.910
She's fallen for someone else?! I'm sure that can't be right!

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:03.120
But even if I did buy her an engagement 
ring, I've neglected Lisa so much lately... {LISA IS TOTALLY A JAPANESE NAME.}

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.210
I wouldn't blame her if she didn't love me anymore!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:09.020
You can't think like that, Toshioka! You need to have more faith in yourself!

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.230
That's right!

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:14.150
Whenever you were going on a date, you always came here to buy flowers for her!

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:17.350
There aren't many guys as kind as you out there!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:20.060
Being kind isn't all it's cracked up to be.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:23.840
So is that why you want the preserved flowers?

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:24.570
Yeah.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:27.210
When I heard that there were flowers that never wilt, I just thought...

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:28.400
"This is it!"

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:30.590
...to myself.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.480
So when I give her the engagement ring,

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:38.110
I want to give her those preserved
 flowers as a sign of my eternal love.

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:41.210
If I do, I might be able to win Lisa's heart back.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:46.170
Oh, I get it! So that's why you want us to find you something nice!

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:50.640
I can't bring myself to give up on him, no matter what.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.350
So if I show him just how pretty I can be...

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.940
I might be able to win back Yuuto's heart.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:06:59.630
Erika!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:00.480
Roger!

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:04.770
When a lady's in love, fashion will always be on her side!

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.740
We understand your feelings perfectly, Lisa!

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.950
So just leave it to us!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.340
Th-Thank you very much!

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.410
But...

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.300
Just the thought of meeting her...

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:16.240
scares me so much!

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:19.260
I'm pathetic, aren't I?

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:23.290
When I think that Lisa's heart might've slipped from my grasp, I just...

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:26.800
completely lose my courage to propose to her!

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.050
No way...

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:29.840
Toshioka.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:34.050
Lisa always loves the flowers you buy for her, right?

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.760
Yes, very much.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:41.730
That's not just because of how pretty they are, you know?

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:45.520
It's because they're from you that they're so special to her.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.530
I wonder if that's really true.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:52.070
Excuse me, Toshioka!

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:57.120
Would you like to bring Lisa to our barbecue?!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:58.810
A barbecue?

00:07:58.810 --> 00:07:59.700
Yeah!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.500
You might not be able to handle it when you're alone,

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:04.580
but if you're having fun with everyone, you might loosen up a bit!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:08.630
That's a good point.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:12.680
So why not just pluck up that little bit of courage and invite him to come along with you?

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:18.260
That's right! If he sees you wearing this, he'll be putty in your hands!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:19.140
All right!

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:25.870
Well then, I'll leave it all to you!

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:34.280
Lights!

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:40.080
You damn annoying Precures!

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:46.590
Aaaaargh! Ever since I went to the human plane, my skin's been so moist that I can't do anything with it!

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:50.170
The dryness of the desert is
 meant to enhance my beauty.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:56.260
All this moistness is preventing my hair from setting!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.010
Kobraja.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:03.140
If it plagues you so, you should reduce their dank and sodden world to sand.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.150
As you wish, my liege.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.110
Then go forth, Kobraja.

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:09.830
Yes, sir.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.840
Good morning.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.860
That customer of yours said he was 
bringing his girlfriend, didn't he, Mizuki?

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:40.430
And didn't the girl from your place say 
she was bringing her boyfriend, Sakura?

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.430
Then are you two...

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:44.000
I'm Toshioka Yuuto.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.390
And I'm Shibata Lisa. {WORST NAME}

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:46.950
Which means...

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.060
...that they're dating!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.360
I guess coincidences do happen, huh?

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.420
Yeah, it really shocked me!

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:00.280
But...

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:04.250
After we have our fun with the barbecue, we're going to go unwind down at the river, right?

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:12.060
Toshioka, try to keep up!

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.170
Ah, right!

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:22.020
They're just falling further apart, and all because of some misunderstanding!

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.340
I'm gonna go sort this out!

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:26.440
Erika, please stop!

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:27.390
What is it?!

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:31.640
He's going to propose to her, you know!

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.690
It's mature and romantic love!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.230
They say "Love is without reason."

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:43.150
That's right. Love is a scoundrel which has rid itself of the shackles of logic and wisdom! {This translation is masturbatory. I love it.}

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:46.860
Though they love each other, they drift so tragically apart.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:48.370
Don't you see, Erika?! {Do -> Don't. Fits better.}

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:52.080
Our role is merely to observe and guide them! {Removed the 'to' before guide - not necessary.}

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.030
All right, all right, I get it...

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:00.220
But it'd be nice if we could do 
something to help them make up.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.880
I suppose you're right.

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.350
If only we had some way of getting them past that misunderstanding.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.180
You done with that, you two?

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:07.680
Dad!

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.370
I was just on my way to the
 suspension bridge over there.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.650
Would you two like to join me?

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:14.580
Are you going to take some photos?

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:17.650
Yeah. I really enjoy admiring the scenery from a bridge like that.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:19.290
A suspension bridge?

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:22.820
That's it! A suspension bridge!

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.980
We can use the Suspension Bridge Effect!

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:25.780
What? {u wot m8?}

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:30.000
Allow me to explain! The Suspension Bridge Effect works thusly!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.870
Lay it on me!

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:36.340
When you're in a high place like a suspension bridge, you feel scared and your heart starts pounding, right?

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:37.780
Does it?

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:38.840
Well, it can...

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.130
That's right, it can! And then... {PUPPET SHOW}

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:45.010
"Oh no, the bridge is shaking!"

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.930
"Oh no, I'm scared! Thump, thump!"

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.100
"Are you all right?"

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:55.650
"Could it be that this pounding in my chest... is love?!"

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.880
And then the two of them fall in love once more!

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:03.230
You really are an interesting girl, Tsubomi!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:06.410
You really give off a "This is Tsubomi!" aura!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.200
Doesn't she?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.200
Anyway...

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:15.010
When their hearts are pounding from the fright, their minds will confuse it for the pangs of love!

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:19.010
Then we can use that confusion to help them make up?

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:20.180
That's right!

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:22.130
In that case, we'll have to tag along after all!

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:25.690
Dad, go invite Toshioka and Lisa to join us, all right?

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:26.550
Roger that.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.810
Wow!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.730
What do you think? It's a nice spot, isn't it?

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.690
Y-Yeah... It may be a little frightening...

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.700
but it's very pretty!

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:45.680
Isn't it? This view is the best!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:50.310
And the air's nice too! But there's more important things to worry about!

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.040
Th-Those clothes sure are pretty!

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.110
Huh?

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:03.870
Th-Thank you...

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:11.700
Damn it, this is pissing me off!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:13.810
Erika, please don't rock it like that!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:19.480
Hey, cut it out! Rocking the 
bridge like that is dangerous!

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:23.690
Well, your dad's gonna head down and take some photos by the river.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.120
Oh, that's it!

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.240
Wait up, Dad! I'm coming too!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:30.620
Huh? Hey, wait, I'm coming too!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.710
Now they're all on their own!

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:41.310
Let's hope Operation: Suspension 
Bridge Effect goes according to plan. {translator's note: 'plan' means 'keikaku'}

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:47.780
S-Sure is nice weather we're having, huh?

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:49.470
Yeah, it is nice out.

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:52.980
R-Really is perfect conditions for a barbecue.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:01.190
Are you all right?

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.070
Y-Yeah...

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.610
This is working out well!

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:09.490
All right! Keep it up, suspension bridge!

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.690
Hey! I'm heading back soon!

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:14.450
We're at the good part right now!

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:16.850
Head back without us, Dad.

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:18.420
All right then, I'll see you back there.

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:22.090
The food's almost ready, so hurry back soon!

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.410
All right!

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:29.310
I-I'm all right now, so...

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:30.700
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.080
<i>My Fairy Drop dress...</i>

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:38.270
<i>Please lend me courage!</i>

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:41.690
Yuuto, please listen!

00:14:42.030 --> 00:14:43.540
Wh-What is it?

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:45.190
Well, well, what have we here... {Can we add an extra 'Well' to his line?}

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:47.680
Such reserved yet loving hearts.

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.400
They're so very beautiful.

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:50.820
That's...

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.620
Kobraja?!

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:56.330
Yet the Flowers of your Hearts seem far less sturdy.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.620
Especially yours, mademoiselle.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.650
The Flower of your Heart is so close to wilting.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.290
I shall steal it away!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:08.480
Flower of the Heart, your moment has come!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.850
Li-Lisa...

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:25.610
Today's Desertrian will have an aquatic flavor, I think.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:30.280
Desertrian, that's your cue!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.060
Erika!

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:36.080
Let's do it!

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:49.940
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.100
Precure!

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:55.720
Open My Heart!

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:43.490
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.540
Cure Blossom!

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:54.190
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:58.670
Cure Marine!

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:06.110
HeartCatch Precure!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:13.260
We'll make you return the Flower of Lisa's Heart!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:14.970
Lisa!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.680
Waaaaaaaateeeeer!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.900
Well this isn't beautiful at all!

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:22.910
It's no wonder things are over between you two when you act like this!

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:24.230
Now go!

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.910
Waaaaaaaaaateeeeeeeer! {WHY IS LISA CRYING}

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:40.530
Marine, leave this to me! {oh yes tell the precure with a WATER THEME to leave it to you well done}

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.800
Marine Impact!

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:55.730
Great as ever, Marine!

00:17:55.730 --> 00:17:56.200
Huh?

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.560
I can't get my hand out!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:04.520
Waaaaaateeeeeeeeeer!

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.360
Marine!

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:17.950
Chypre, Coffret!

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.250
Thank goodness...

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:30.750
Yuuto...

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.400
I don't have any confidence in myself.

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:38.150
That's why even though I know you love me, I still feel so anxious!

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:40.930
I feel so scared, but I don't want to!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.540
What? What's it saying?!

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:46.890
Those are Lisa's true feelings for you!

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:48.890
Lisa's true feelings?

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:52.980
Waaaaaaaaaateeeeeeeeeer!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.150
Desertrian!

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:58.500
Don't be distracted by this pointless talk of love and romance!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:00.280
It's not pointless!

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:03.080
Our love is genuine!

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:04.400
Look at these!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:06.180
They're the tulips you love so much!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.750
In the language of flowers, they symbolize eternal love!

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:15.710
I swear my eternal love for you with these immortal tulips!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:20.010
Lisa! Please marry me!

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:29.730
What?!

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:31.020
Lisa!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.270
You've really moved me, Toshioka!

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.730
So I'll use the Pink Forte Wave...

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.690
and bring the two of you back together!

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:40.740
Hey, what about me?!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:52.120
Gather, Floral Power!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:55.750
Blossom Tact!

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:06.180
Flowers, shine forth!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:13.950
Precure Pink Forte Wave!

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:39.090
Marine, are you all right?!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:41.720
Love is kinda addictive...

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.780
Tch! Next time, you shan't be so lucky!

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.010
Adieu! {Shalln't -> shan't}

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:54.140
This flower belongs to you.

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:56.100
Now hurry and return her to normal!

00:20:56.490 --> 00:20:57.230
Right!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.890
Your words can't have been a dream.

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:07.740
They weren't.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.540
This is no dream.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:11.580
Lisa, let's get married.

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:23.130
Loving someone can be so troubling at times, but it's still so beautiful. {Which means he put it on her while she was unconscious.}

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:25.470
Lisa seems so happy! {NOT CREEPY AT ALL.}

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:32.060
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born!

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:46.980
With this, the Great Heart Tree will recover a little more!

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.410
All we need is love, huh?

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:52.930
Yeah, you're right!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:09.960
{ED}

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:18.850
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:21.770
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:24.690
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:27.650
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.700 --> 00:22:36.200
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:39.160
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:42.330
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:44.840
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:48.210
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.510 --> 00:22:50.760
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:53.760
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:56.600
is about to begin!

00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:59.810
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.930 --> 00:23:02.730
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:03.020 --> 00:23:05.690
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:07.240
We're pretty

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:08.990
at full bloom!

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:12.160
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:15.210
until it shines

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:16.750
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.920 --> 00:23:21.000
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.380 --> 00:23:24.010
So don't sulk

00:23:24.220 --> 00:23:26.930
because a smile's the best!

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:30.390
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:33.600
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:36.480
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:39.890
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:45.820
<i>I've been dreaming about Cure Moonlight again recently...</i>

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:47.090
<i>Cure Moonlight?!</i>

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:48.490
<i>Could it be some kind of sign?!</i>

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:49.920
<i>Where could she be?</i>

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:51.550
<i>She might be closer than you think!</i>

00:23:51.550 --> 00:23:52.820
<i>What if she's really Momoka?!</i>

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:53.780
<i>No way!</i>

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:54.620
<i>Ms. Tsurusaki?!</i>

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:55.740
<i>It could be.</i>

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:58.080
<i>How about that cute guy that keeps saving us?!</i>

00:23:58.080 --> 00:23:59.670
<i>Don't be ridiculous!</i>

00:24:00.390 --> 00:24:02.290
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:05.840
The Truth is Revealed<i>!</i>

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:05.840
The Truth is Revealed<i>!</i>

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:08.250
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
